keywords:
  - RECD
  - excess3
  - ordinal patterns
  - nested time
  - Systemic Tau
  - complexity
abstract: >-
  Pure-NumPy implementation of nested ordinal conjunction levels (Φ1, Φ2, Φ3),
  continuous excess³ (exportable hybrid proxy 0.6·Syn + 0.4·Surp; not the
  definition of strong Level-3), optional Res_pair = KL(P || P^(2)),
  Gibbs-α weights, phase-shuffle nulls on |Δ excess3|, and λ-weighted
  Discrete Extramental Clock. Canonical software for the excess³ methods
  specification and the Systemic Tau / RECD foundations paper.
